    ],
    "text": "Team #54164"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000039",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "furniture",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0000-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "Page 2 of 42"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000040",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0001-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "width of the bathtub, and attaches onto the faucet. The hot water from the faucet is then funneled"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000041",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0001-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "through the device towards the bottom of the tub, creating a Jacuzzi-like e\ufb00ect. The hot water"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000042",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0001-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "then rises to the surface, mixing with the water above it and creating an evenly distributed, uniform"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000043",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0001-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "temperature throughout the tub."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000044",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0002-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "Now that we can keep the temperature consistent throughout the tub, we\u2019re still left to \ufb01gure"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000045",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0002-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "out how high we should turn our faucet to keep the water from going cold."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000046",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0003-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "Of course, turning it too high is a waste of water and, on top of that, can increase the temperature"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000047",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0003-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "to uncomfortably high levels. Too low, and we get to wade around in lukewarm to cold waters that"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000048",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0003-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "make us not want to take a bath at all. So we want to \ufb01nd the optimal \ufb02ow rate on our faucet that"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000049",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0003-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "gets our temperature to where we want it to be."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000050",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0004-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "Not all bathtubs were created equal. The optimal \ufb02ow rate isn\u2019t a set rate for all bathtubs."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000051",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0004-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "For the standard 60\u201dx30\u201dx14\u201d bathtub, we suggest turning the faucet up to about a ninth of"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000052",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0004-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "its max."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000053",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0005-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "To conserve even more hot water, you even have the option of purchasing products like the"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000054",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0005-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u201dWater Blanket\u201d (\u201dWater Blanket\u201d) to keep the temperature of the bath warmer. Interestingly"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000055",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0005-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "enough, even bubble bath can keep your bath water hotter for longer. And no, it\u2019s not \u201djust for"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000056",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "contents",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0006",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0005-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "kids.\u201d"
  },
